N 51° 11.827 W 113° 58.892&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A quick stop before my apt at the nearby big box store.  I actually thought this cap was closer to the nearby shopping establishment.  It seems like every time I come out here, there's further expansion.  Road near GZ quiet and cap was easy to get to and well marked thankfully.  TFanotherBC.  Sad to see only another week left of &quot;official&quot; logging left. :-(&lt;/p&gt;

