&lt;p&gt;Heading back South towards Calgary and the rain has now started.  It's quiet enough on the West side of the road to stop, run across the street and get the cap info and a context shot without getting too wet.  Cap info sent to CO.  Thanks for setting up the caps!&lt;/p&gt;

